{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 395410, "name": "Martino Papero", "username": "martymarty004", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/{size}/39025_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-16T12:59:45.440Z", "cooked": "<p>Hello,<br>\nToday I updated my system from Fedora 41 KDE Spin to Fedora 42 using Discover.</p>\n<p>Everything looked fine, but when it was time to use some Java application I needed, I discovered that the package <code>java-1.8.0-openjdk.x86_64</code> had been removed during the update (the last time I used the app was just before the reboot).</p>\n<p>That was odd, but since I didn’t have much time to investigate, I simply tried reinstalling it, but DNF doesn’t find it in the default repositories. (<code>dnf search openjdk</code> only returns <code>latest</code> and <code>java-21</code>).</p>\n<p>Does anyone know what could have happened? To fix this, I could probably just add the official repo from <a href=\"https://adoptium.net/installation/linux/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Adoptium</a>, but it seems strange for these LTS packages to be missing from the <code>Fedora 42 - x86_64</code> repo.</p>\n<p>Eventually, can someone tell me where to find the update logs to check for errors?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-16T13:03:26.951Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 7546, "reads": 91, "readers_count": 90, "score": 37778.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "Martino Papero", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 2, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://adoptium.net/installation/linux/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 167}, {"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/installing-intune-portal-on-fedora-42/156807/4", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "Installing intune-portal on Fedora 42", "clicks": 2}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 21734, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 395413, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-16T13:03:17.605Z", "cooked": "<p>It looks like this change:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ThirdPartyLegacyJdks\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/6/4/64c92df35f95842f9f925fedcafeab613a187170.png\" class=\"site-icon\" data-dominant-color=\"70B3E0\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ThirdPartyLegacyJdks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fedoraproject.org</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ThirdPartyLegacyJdks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Changes/ThirdPartyLegacyJdks - Fedora Project Wiki</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>The wiki page includes information on using the Adoptium Temurin repositories etc.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-16T13:03:17.605Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 137, "reads": 87, "readers_count": 86, "score": 737.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ThirdPartyLegacyJdks", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Changes/ThirdPartyLegacyJdks - Fedora Project Wiki", "clicks": 1031}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 395444, "name": "Martino Papero", "username": "martymarty004", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/{size}/39025_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-16T13:50:32.283Z", "cooked": "<p>Yep, I can confirm that this was the issue.<br>\nThe package was probably removed because it was marked as orphaned.</p>\n<p>There is this new package <code>adoptium-temurin-java-repository</code>, which automatically configures the repository from Adoptium. It was installed by default, but the repository was not active (just like it says on the page you linked).</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nThe repository offers the following packages:</summary>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"txt\"><code class=\"lang-txt\"> temurin-11-jdk.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 11 JDK\n temurin-11-jre.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 11 JRE\n temurin-17-jdk.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 17 JDK\n temurin-17-jre.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 17 JRE\n temurin-21-jdk.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 21 JDK\n temurin-21-jre.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 21 JRE\n temurin-23-jdk.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 23 JDK\n temurin-23-jre.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 23 JRE\n temurin-24-jdk.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 24 JDK\n temurin-24-jre.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 24 JRE\n temurin-8-jdk.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 8 JDK\n temurin-8-jre.x86_64: Eclipse Temurin 8 JRE\n</code></pre>\n</details>\n<p>After enabling the repository, I was able to easily install <code>temurin-8-jdk</code>, along with <code>IcedTea-Web</code> which was removed as well, probably because it lost its dependencies.</p>\n<p>The only tedious part was fixing up all the ENV variables I used to select the appropriate version for each program, like this:<br>\n<code>JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/java-1.8.0-openjdk.x86_64</code> → <code>JAVA_HOME=/usr/lib/jvm/temurin-8-jdk</code></p>\n<p>Everything seems to be working fine now, thanks for the help!</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-16T13:50:32.283Z", "reply_count": 4, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 80, "reads": 85, "readers_count": 84, "score": 467.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "Martino Papero", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 78, "username": "ankursinha", "name": "FranciscoD", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 21734, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/4", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 395487, "name": "Martino Papero", "username": "martymarty004", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/{size}/39025_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-16T14:34:00.651Z", "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ankursinha\">@ankursinha</a> I’d like to ask one more thing, since I have never had similar issues before:<br>\nDoes the upgrade tool never warn the user about the orphaned packages that are going to be removed? Should I always use <code>dnf system-upgrade</code> instead in order to have a verbose output?</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-16T14:34:00.651Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 29, "reads": 72, "readers_count": 71, "score": 159.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "Martino Papero", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 21734, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [{"id": 78, "username": "ankursinha", "name": "FranciscoD", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png"}], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 395490, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-16T14:40:30.150Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"martymarty004\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"148870\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/48/39025_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Martino Papero:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The only tedious part was fixing up all the ENV variables I used to select the appropriate version for each program, like this:</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah, is it not using the <code>alternatives</code> system that the Java packages used to use before?</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-16T14:40:30.150Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 41, "reads": 71, "readers_count": 70, "score": 224.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 21734, "username": "martymarty004", "name": "Martino Papero", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/{size}/39025_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 395504, "name": "Martino Papero", "username": "martymarty004", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/{size}/39025_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-16T14:58:31.425Z", "cooked": "<p><code>alternatives</code> lists both OpenJDK and Temurin java versions without issues:</p>\n<details>\n<summary>\nsudo alternatives --config java</summary>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"txt\"><code class=\"lang-txt\">There are 3 programs which provide 'java'.\n\n  Selection    Command\n-----------------------------------------------\n*+ 1           /usr/lib/jvm/java-21-openjdk/bin/java\n   2           /usr/lib/jvm/temurin-8-jdk/bin/java\n   3           /usr/lib/jvm/temurin-17-jdk/bin/java\n</code></pre>\n</details>\n<p>It’s the software that I need to run that is old and needs to be launched with a specific version in order to work, so I have Java 21 as default for everything and I change the path just for those specific programs.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-16T14:58:31.425Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 70, "reads": 66, "readers_count": 65, "score": 378.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "Martino Papero", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 78, "username": "ankursinha", "name": "FranciscoD", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 21734, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/7", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 398022, "name": "Jared Komoroski", "username": "jkomoroski", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/jkomoroski/{size}/12241_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-22T15:11:56.128Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"martymarty004\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"148870\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/48/39025_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Martino Papero:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>After enabling the repository</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I could not find the instructions to properly enable this repo anywhere. I used the following command</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">dnf config-manager setopt adoptium-temurin-java-repository.enabled=1\n</code></pre>\n<p>From there I installed the old jdks I needed</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">dnf install temurin-11-jdk temurin-17-jdk temurin-21-jdk temurin-8-jdk\n</code></pre>\n<p>Is there a better way to enable the repo?</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-22T15:11:56.128Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 44, "reads": 56, "readers_count": 55, "score": 256.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "Jared Komoroski", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 7291, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/8", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 398117, "name": "Martino Papero", "username": "martymarty004", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/martymarty004/{size}/39025_2.png", "created_at": "2025-04-22T18:16:47.174Z", "cooked": "<p>To enable the Adoptium repository, I simply used the Settings page inside Discover.</p>\n<p>The commands you mentioned do the exact same thing as flagging the repo as active and applying the config.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/3X/7/4/7479525fbfd250a40a762785f56cb575be8dcbcc.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/gCnjFB3qisP1yIt7KOqiG4U8QQA.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/7/4/7479525fbfd250a40a762785f56cb575be8dcbcc_2_345x162.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"gCnjFB3qisP1yIt7KOqiG4U8QQA\" width=\"345\" height=\"162\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/7/4/7479525fbfd250a40a762785f56cb575be8dcbcc_2_345x162.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/7/4/7479525fbfd250a40a762785f56cb575be8dcbcc_2_517x243.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/optimized/3X/7/4/7479525fbfd250a40a762785f56cb575be8dcbcc_2_690x324.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"24282C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">940×442 58 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 12, "updated_at": "2025-04-22T18:16:47.174Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 8, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 26, "reads": 53, "readers_count": 52, "score": 155.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 148870, "topic_slug": "old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42", "display_username": "Martino Papero", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 7291, "username": "jkomoroski", "name": "Jared Komoroski", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/jkomoroski/{size}/12241_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 21734, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/old-java-lts-versions-unavailable-on-f42/148870/9", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 401425, "name": "Drew Dittmann", "username": "dditty", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/51a2da/{size}.png", "created_at": "2025-05-04T16:29:54.233Z", "cooked": "<p>This worked perfectly for me, thanks! I needed java jdk 17 for running my minecraft server (1.20.4). After upgrading to Fedora Server 42, I already had the temurin repository but needed to enable it like 